# Capability `price.quote`, entered at 400. The declaration's `default: 1`
# for qty is an annotation: the chassis never fills it in, so the rule that
# answers applies it when the call left qty out.
WHEN @src == "cap" && @cap.name == "price.quote" && @cap.input.sku =~ /./
  EMIT ._cap.output.sku = @cap.input.sku,
       ._cap.output.qty = @cap.input.qty,
       ._cap.output.unit_price = 12.5,
       ._cap.output.currency = "EUR"
